nd we shall keep it to ourselves, for a price.&quot;<br /> <b>Dougal:</b> &quot;Ahh no really this never happens, here let me try the pullstart one more time.&quot;<br /> <b>Liam:</b> &quot;Well... A bit common... But still...&quot;<br /> <b>Fiona:</b> &quot;I fear no challenge. And when size isn't enough, I have skill to supplement!&quot;<br /> <b>Leanhaun:</b> &quot;I may not be the biggest, but I can make the moment last forever...&quot;<br /> <b>Balor:</b> &quot;Mine? Well do amours tentacles I use on mortal school girls count?&quot;<br /> <b>Scathach:</b> &quot;*chop* I have the biggest.&quot;<br /> <b>Daireann:</b> &quot;Big Dig eh? Well I tell you, I can't brag about myself of course, but I met this one troll with this massive member, used to stick it in countess Tara all the time... err.. shit.. did I say that?&quot;<br /> <b>Aesin:</b> &quot;Many would say we are all d**k. I am not sure what they mean&quot;<br /> <b>Varich:</b> &quot;The only d**k I see here is you. Draw.&quot;<br /> <b>Beaumayn:</b> &quot;It might not be much to look at now, but I predict in the future it might be? *Looking over at the Fiona.*&quot;<br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:48px\"><b>D**k measuring between the Kiths.</b></span></span><br /> <b>Satyrs:</b> &quot;You gotta be kidding right? Just look at this thing!&quot;<br /> <b>Trolls:</b> &quot;Where do you think all this shade is coming from?&quot;<br /> <b>Pooka:</b> &quot;I once had a d**k this big! No really, it was only five moments ago when I was looking at that Sluagh.&quot;<br /> <b>Sidhe:</b> &quot;How can you all ever hope to compare?&quot;<br /> <b>Eshu:</b> &quot;Well it used to be bigger....hey did I ever tell you the story about the time I went skinny dipping with ten redcaps?&quot;<br /> <b>Boggan:</b> &quot;It's not the size that counts. It's how you use it.&quot;<br /> <b>Nocker:</b> &quot;Just give me a moment with this machine of mine. ....Ow..ow...fuck'in hell....&quot;<br /> <b>Redcap:</b> &quot;*Growl* Did ya have sum'thin ta say about my package?&quot;<br /> <b>Sluagh:</b> &quot;I can stretch AND bend...&quot;<br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:48px\"><b>D**k measuring between the Gallain.</b></span></span><br /> <b>Ghille Dhu:</b> &quot;Grow... Grow!&quot;<br /> <b>Clurichaun:</b> &quot;We're called the little people for a reason, you know...&quot;<br /> <b>Piskies:</b> &quot;What? With all these goodies presented how am I supposed to keep my fingers to myself...&quot;<br /> <b>Selkies:</b> &quot;This is all very hairy...&quot;<br /> <b>Merfolk:</b> &quot;*whips out fin*&quot;<br /> <b>Menehune:</b> &quot;Big Kahuna!&quot;<br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:48px\"><b>D**k measuring between the Thallain.</b></span></span><br /> <b>Ogre:</b> &quot;Huh? Taste like Chicken...&quot;<br /> <b>Beastie:</b> &quot;*roar...shifts back* Mine is bigger... What do you mean you can't remember?!&quot;<br /> <b>Bogey:</b> &quot;Gee, *slurp* you really wanna see?&quot;<br /> <b>Boggart:</b> &quot;Just let me call a few of my friends over.......then we will see who's is bigger.&quot;<br /> <b>Arthu:</b> &quot;I don't wanna hear any stories. Just show me.&quot;<br /> <b>River Hag:</b> &quot;I'll get you, my pretty, and your little buddy too...*Cackle*&quot;<br /> <b>Spriggan:</b> &quot;I can call down a storm with mine. *Sneer* What can yours do?&quot;<br /> <b>Goblin:</b> &quot;*BOOM!* Wrong pocket...&quot;<br /> <b>Murdhuacha:</b>&quot;I am a d**k. Moby Dick.&quot;<br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:48px\"><b>D**k measuring between the Nunnehi.</b></span></span><br /> <b>Pu'Gwis:</b> &quot;*falls apart* I hate when that happens...&quot;<br /> <b>May-may-gway-shi:</b> &quot;You wanna look at my rocks and follow the brook between them?&quot;<br /> <b>Rock Giants:</b> &quot;Yeah, I have solid stones.&quot